## 1. The loop in one screen

1. **Before coding** — the phase is approved and ready; pre-flight the task interfaces ([01]({{ref_01}})).
2. **Per task** — read & ground → edit only the task's files → run its check → triage against the expected result → tick and re-read the plan ([02]({{ref_02}})).
3. **Phase end** — full suite, visual check (UI), self bug-hunt, simplicity pass, evidence; contract changes go back to the gate ([03]({{ref_03}})).
4. **Hand-off** — committed review revision, evidence and exactly one status ([03]({{ref_03}})).

